\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Prompt-equalized detection accuracy by model scale (LOO pipeline in blue, hedging regex in orange; error bars: bootstrap 95\% CIs). Models $\leq $7B cluster at 61--74\% and models $\geq $14B at 82.5--84\% (pooled group difference $p < 0.0001$); no individual adjacent increment is significant after Holm-Bonferroni correction. The within-family Qwen pair (7B: 74\%, 14B: 82.5\%) is directionally consistent (Fisher $p=0.17$). The hedging regex baseline is at or above the LLM pipeline at every scale point.}}{22}{figure.caption.54}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:scale_trend}{{2}{22}{Prompt-equalized detection accuracy by model scale (LOO pipeline in blue, hedging regex in orange; error bars: bootstrap 95\% CIs). Models $\leq $7B cluster at 61--74\% and models $\geq $14B at 82.5--84\% (pooled group difference $p < 0.0001$); no individual adjacent increment is significant after Holm-Bonferroni correction. The within-family Qwen pair (7B: 74\%, 14B: 82.5\%) is directionally consistent (Fisher $p=0.17$). The hedging regex baseline is at or above the LLM pipeline at every scale point}{figure.caption.54}{}}
